1
00:00:01,919 --> 00:00:02,919
Would you like beer?

2
00:00:04,213 --> 00:00:05,797
Or whiskey?

3
00:00:05,923 --> 00:00:07,216
I also got soju

4
00:00:07,341 --> 00:00:08,842
No thanks

5
00:00:08,967 --> 00:00:09,967
Just fill it in

6
00:00:10,886 --> 00:00:12,262
What's this?

7
00:00:12,387 --> 00:00:14,056
It's 100 questions
and answers

8
00:00:14,181 --> 00:00:16,350
Let's fill it in
and memorize it

9
00:00:19,019 --> 00:00:21,021
Weren't you the one
who hated doing this?

10
00:00:21,146 --> 00:00:22,856
You're working so hard

11
00:00:22,981 --> 00:00:25,692
I might as well do it
properly

12
00:00:27,611 --> 00:00:30,072
All the answers
can be searched online

13
00:00:31,156 --> 00:00:32,175
You've never
looked up my name?

14
00:00:32,199 --> 00:00:33,575
Yes, I have

15
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:36,912
28 years old, a former
member of Alphadog

16
00:00:37,037 --> 00:00:38,455
I just need
more details

17
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:40,415
You can ask me

18
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:41,540
anything you want

19
00:00:42,834 --> 00:00:44,154
Wouldn't this be
easier than that?

20
00:00:50,133 --> 00:00:52,177
Weren't you lost
on the way here?

21
00:00:52,302 --> 00:00:53,542
I was gonna go
pick you up, but…

22
00:00:53,637 --> 00:00:56,515
My friend lives here
so I know the way

23
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:57,640
Friend?

24
00:00:57,683 --> 00:00:58,683
An actor friend?

25
00:00:58,725 --> 00:01:01,270
We used to act together
since childhood

26
00:01:01,395 --> 00:01:03,313
Now he's working
in producing team

27
00:01:03,438 --> 00:01:06,441
You guys must've been
quite close then

28
00:01:06,566 --> 00:01:07,401
Right

29
00:01:07,526 --> 00:01:08,526
We're close

30
00:01:10,237 --> 00:01:11,488
Have you ever heard…

31
00:01:13,573 --> 00:01:14,957
the news
about a child actor

32
00:01:15,041 --> 00:01:17,536
who was missing
at a shooting set

33
00:01:18,578 --> 00:01:19,578
and found later?

34
00:01:21,498 --> 00:01:23,166
Is anybody there?

35
00:01:25,335 --> 00:01:27,004
Anybody?

36
00:01:27,129 --> 00:01:28,922
It's already been
over about ten years

37
00:01:30,299 --> 00:01:31,425
The boy was rescued

38
00:01:33,218 --> 00:01:35,387
from the warehouse
